    "description_md": "Discrete profile dissolved inorganic carbon (DIC) and total alkalinity (TA) from CalCOFI Niskin bottle samples, quality-controlled using WOCE flagging. Values on a Niskin the bottle database also carries are published once, on that bottle. Values on a sample that matches no bottle cast are published too, wherever the source gives the sample a depth, on the sample's own key: they are not linked to a bottle cast (the source names none), and the date of most of them is month-precision only (see questions calcofi_dic_01 and calcofi_dic_07).\n",
    "keywords": ["EARTH SCIENCE > OCEANS > OCEAN CHEMISTRY > INORGANIC CARBON", "EARTH SCIENCE > OCEANS > OCEAN CHEMISTRY > ALKALINITY", "EARTH SCIENCE > OCEANS > OCEAN CHEMISTRY > PH", "EARTH SCIENCE > OCEANS > OCEAN TEMPERATURE > WATER TEMPERATURE", "EARTH SCIENCE > OCEANS > SALINITY/DENSITY > OCEAN SALINITY", "Temperature", "Salinity", "Ocean Acidification and Hypoxia"],
